  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TCPF: Sustainable management of Miombo woodlands through improved livelihood strategies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the TCP facility are to i) conduct a desk study on the livelihood challenges in Miombo woodlands of southern Africa, ii) discuss the findings with government counterparts, and iii) develop a theory of change for improved regional collaboration on Miombo woodlands in southern Africa</narrative>
  </description>
